Xanthin Oreskalka was a member of the [[Org/Althane/Oreskalka Cabal|Oreskalka Cabal]] and a blood relative of [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]]. He was a human man, older, sunbaked, with a long-healed gouge of a scar across his forehead, and he held blue clearance at the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]], high enough to reach into its underground complexes; he had also taken material above his clearance. He is dead. His still-beating heart was cut from him while he lived, and it now counts as a living person, a spirit print that can be carried in his place.
